---
source: crates/squawk_linter/src/rules/changing_column_type.rs
expression: "lint_errors(sql, Rule::ChangingColumnType)"
---
warning[changing-column-type]: changing a column type rewrites the table under an `access exclusive` lock
  ╭▸ 
6 │ ALTER TABLE "core_recipe" ALTER COLUMN "foo" TYPE varchar(255) USING "foo"::varchar(255);
  │                                              ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
  │
  ╰ note: the lock blocks reads and writes while the table is rewritten, and the new type may break other clients reading from the table
warning[changing-column-type]: changing a column type rewrites the table under an `access exclusive` lock
  ╭▸ 
7 │ ALTER TABLE "core_recipe" ALTER COLUMN "foo" TYPE text USING "foo"::text;
  │                                              ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
  │
  ╰ note: the lock blocks reads and writes while the table is rewritten, and the new type may break other clients reading from the table
